    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 18th level, your destructive potential reaches its apex. When you use Breakdown, the destroyed weapon shatters into shrapnel. Each creature of your choice within 10 feet must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier). On a failed save, a creature takes damage equal to your improvised weapon damage die + your Strength modifier.</p>\n<p>Additionally, your Breakdown no longer has a limited number of uses.</p>",
